{"id":"486979","name":"菠菜豆腐汤","author":"悦悦玉食","authorId":"2272341","desc":"","cover":"images/486979/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老豆腐","amount":"1块"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老豆腐洗净，切小丁，用淡盐水浸泡10分钟左右。","img":"images/486979/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠菜洗净，焯水。","img":"images/486979/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"焯好的菠菜切小段。","img":"images/486979/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中加水烧开，沥干水分的豆腐丁，煮至开锅！","img":"images/486979/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入菠菜段再次煮开。","img":"images/486979/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加盐和胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/486979/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量香油即可。","img":"images/486979/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}